### Mini-Prontuario - banco de testes da API
### Extensao necessaria: "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
### Clique em "Send Request" acima de cada bloco.

@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. O servidor esta vivo?  -> esperado 200
GET {{host}}/api/health

### 2. Listar pacientes  -> esperado 200 + array
GET {{host}}/api/patients

### 3. Buscar um paciente que existe  -> esperado 200
GET {{host}}/api/patients/1

### 4. Buscar um paciente que NAO existe  -> esperado 404
GET {{host}}/api/patients/9999

### 5. Criar paciente valido  -> esperado 201
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Joana Ribeiro Alencar",
  "birthDate": "1990-04-12",
  "nationalId": "700012345678999"
}

### 6. FALHA PROPOSITAL: sem name  -> esperado 400
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "birthDate": "1990-04-12",
  "nationalId": "700012345678911"
}

### 7. FALHA PROPOSITAL: name so com espacos  -> esperado 400
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "     ",
  "birthDate": "1990-04-12",
  "nationalId": "700012345678912"
}

### 8. FALHA PROPOSITAL: data fora do formato  -> esperado 400
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teste Data Errada",
  "birthDate": "12/04/1990",
  "nationalId": "700012345678913"
}

### 9. FALHA PROPOSITAL: sem Content-Type
### Sem o cabecalho, express.json() nao le o corpo -> req.body fica vazio
POST {{host}}/api/patients

{
  "name": "Teste Sem Content-Type",
  "birthDate": "1990-04-12",
  "nationalId": "700012345678914"
}

### ==========================================================
### ATIVIDADE - Encounters
### ==========================================================

### 10. Listar atendimentos do paciente 1  -> esperado 200
GET {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters

### 11. Criar atendimento  -> esperado 201
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-17T09:30",
  "chiefComplaint": "Cefaleia ha tres dias",
  "notes": "Orientada hidratacao e retorno em 7 dias."
}

### 12. FALHA PROPOSITAL: sem chiefComplaint  -> esperado 400
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-17T09:30"
}

### 13. FALHA PROPOSITAL: paciente inexistente  -> esperado 404
POST {{host}}/api/patients/9999/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-17T09:30",
  "chiefComplaint": "Teste"
}

### 14. FALHA PROPOSITAL: GET paciente inexistente -> esperado 404
GET {{host}}/api/patients/9999/encounters

### 15. FALHA PROPOSITAL: startedAt inválido -> esperado 400
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "17/08/2026 09:30",
  "chiefComplaint": "Teste"
}

### 16. FALHA PROPOSITAL: chiefComplaint somente espaços -> esperado 400
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-17T09:30",
  "chiefComplaint": "     "
}

### 17. notes ausente -> esperado 201 e notes null
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-18T10:00",
  "chiefComplaint": "Retorno"
}

### ==========================================================
### NÍVEL 2 - TELA DE DETALHE E ATENDIMENTOS
### ==========================================================

### 18. Criar paciente com nationalId já existente -> esperado 409
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Paciente Duplicado",
  "birthDate": "1995-05-20",
  "nationalId": "700012345678999"
}

### 19. Buscar o paciente criado no teste 5 -> esperado 200
### Use o ID retornado pelo teste 5 se não for 1.
GET {{host}}/api/patients/1

### 20. Criar atendimento com notes vazio -> esperado 201 e notes null
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-19T14:00",
  "chiefComplaint": "Consulta de retorno",
  "notes": ""
}

### 21. Criar atendimento com notes somente espaços -> esperado 201 e notes null
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-20T08:30",
  "chiefComplaint": "Acompanhamento",
  "notes": "     "
}

### 22. Criar atendimento com startedAt contendo segundos -> esperado 400
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-20T08:30:00",
  "chiefComplaint": "Teste segundos"
}

### 23. Criar atendimento sem startedAt -> esperado 400
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chiefComplaint": "Teste sem data"
}

### 24. Criar atendimento com chiefComplaint vazio -> esperado 400
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-21T10:00",
  "chiefComplaint": ""
}

### 25. Listar novamente os atendimentos do paciente 1
### Deve aparecer os atendimentos criados nos testes anteriores.
GET {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters

### 26. Criar atendimento com notas preenchidas
### esperado 201 e notes com o texto enviado
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-22T16:45",
  "chiefComplaint": "Dor abdominal",
  "notes": "Paciente relatou melhora após repouso."
}

### 27. Verificar se os atendimentos continuam associados ao paciente correto
GET {{host}}/api/patients/2/encounters

### 28. Tentar criar atendimento para paciente inexistente
### mesmo com dados válidos -> esperado 404
POST {{host}}/api/patients/8888/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-23T11:20",
  "chiefComplaint": "Paciente inexistente",
  "notes": "Teste de integridade."
}

### 29. Data válida no limite do formato -> esperado 201
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-01-01T00:00",
  "chiefComplaint": "Teste de data limite"
}

### 30. Listar atendimentos após vários cadastros
### esperado 200 + array com os atendimentos criados
GET {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters